  "goodToKnow": "Die Kollektion is a collection, mainly of fashion or designed products: die Frühjahrskollektion, eine limitierte Kollektion. A collection of art, stamps or objects in a museum is die Sammlung. Germany's fashion scene includes Berlin Fashion Week and brands like Hugo Boss in Metzingen and Adidas and Puma, both founded by the Dassler brothers in Herzogenaurach. Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Kollektionen."
